// Color Spray: a cone of dazzling colors that overwhelms sight, no direct
// damage -- the sheet explicitly flags this (`data.dmg empty`), only an
// "illusion control rider (blind/frighten/incapacitate)". Modeled with the
// existing `BuffKind::Blinded` (common/src/comp/buff.rs: "can't aim --
// outgoing attack damage is reduced by strength"), applied as an on-hit buff
// via `Shockwave`'s `damage_effect` field -- the same shape
// `assets/common/abilities/innate/draugr.ron`'s Gravechill burst already
// uses for its own on-hit Chilled application.
// `damage`/`poise_damage`/`knockback.strength` are kept at 0 rather than
// omitted: `Shockwave` has no "damage-optional" mode (unlike `GroundAoe`'s
// `pooled_debuff`, see spells/arcane/sleep.ron's own note on that
// convention), so those fields stay in the RON shape as literal no-ops.
// `shockwave_speed * shockwave_duration = 5.0` is set to match the sheet's
// `Cone 5` reach exactly; `shockwave_angle: 90.0` follows the same cone-spread
// convention every other cone Shockwave in this compendium already uses
// (crimson_lash.ron, pulse_wave.ron).
Shockwave(
    energy_cost: 45.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    swing_duration: 0.15,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    damage: 0.0,
    poise_damage: 0.0,
    knockback: (strength: 0.0, direction: Away),
    shockwave_angle: 90.0,
    shockwave_vertical_angle: 45.0,
    shockwave_speed: 10.0,
    shockwave_duration: 0.5,
    dodgeable: Jump,
    move_efficiency: 0.1,
    damage_kind: Psychic,
    specifier: Ground,
    ori_rate: 1.0,
    damage_effect: Some(Buff((
        kind: Blinded,
        dur_secs: 8.0,
        strength: Value(1.0),
        chance: 1.0,
    ))),
    timing: PostBuildup,
    emit_outcome: true,
    meta: (school: Some(Illusion), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
